# Docs first

- Before wide codebase search, read `docs/README.md` and the relevant `docs/features/` or `docs/components/` file.
- After meaningful feature changes, update the matching doc (same laconic format).
- Do not add new markdown files at repo root; use `docs/` subfolders.
